Author: Wenju He <wenju.he@intel.com>
Date:   Thu Jun 27 01:36:32 2024 -0700

    [LLVM->SPIRV] Fix target id in decorates when there is forward decl (#2606)
    
    When there is forward declaration of a spirv entry, its decorates are
