    void pointer. This patch fixes a bug, when Intel blocking pipes
    built-ins were having second argument with the same type as data
    stored in pipe. This bug could lead to a situation, when two pipe
    blocking instruction were translated to LLVM IR to two functions with
    different arguments types, but sharing the same name which is illegal.
    
