commit 3d1c01e31491365324c5d0ac2f4c69833b50f3ec
Author: Andrzej Ratajewski <andrzej.ratajewski@intel.com>
Date:   Fri Jun 28 09:31:29 2019 +0200

    Reimplement the way of ocl builtins mutations
    
    SPIR-V -> OCL20 -> OCL12 approach needed to be reimplemented due to
    important data looses while tranlating to v2.0. For some cases, it was
    impossible to properly translate builtin to v1.2 if it was already
    translated to v2.0.
    The new approach gathers common (for v1.2 and v2.0) translation
    implementation into SPIRVToOCL class. Then SPIRVToOCL12 and SPIRVToOCL20
    inherits from it. It leads to the following possible translations:
    1. SPIR-V -> OCL12
    2. SPIR-V -> OCL20

