    Revert "Fixing preservation of unsignedness for read_imageui functions"
    
    This reverts commit 930da2f2fd2d21f0f2c63ef9406fc9228783ca80, as we
    realized:
     - this patch misses other read_image cases,
     - the same approach will not work for write_image,
     - the test case went missing, and
     - it is not the ideal solution going forward, as the OpenCL SPIR-V
       Environment Specification forbids signedness semantics for
       OpTypeInt.
    
    A more robust approach to handle read_image and write_image signedness
    will be addressed in a future SPIR-V release.

