Author: Alexey Bader <alexey.bader@intel.com>
Date:   Mon Mar 28 18:05:31 2016 +0300

    [SPIR-V] Fix OpImageQuerySize regression test on Ubuntu.
    
    GCC compiler discover undefined behaviour during translation of get_image_* built-ins.
     - move computation of image dimension from mutateCallInstSPIRV argument, since it's used by next argument.
       It's undefined behaviour since order of argument expression computation is not defined.
     - specify type for ExtractElementInst index, since compiler incorrectly assign it to StringSwitch reference, which is returned by Case method.
       Alternative way to fix it would be to end with Default() method returning correct data type.

