    [Reader] Fixes to mangling of pipe built-ins (align with SPIR 2.0
    provisional specification):
      * pipe is a pointer to opaque struct that resides in global addrspace
        (encoded as PU3AS1) (but the addrspace can be changed via
        SPIRV_PIPE_ADDR_SPACE define) to allow vendors be flexible with
        the addrspace.
