Author: Alexey Bader <alexey.bader@intel.com>
Date:   Fri Aug 21 13:52:53 2015 +0300

    [SPIRV] Fix prefix for C++ built-in function names.
    
    We agreed with OpenCL C++ developers that all the functions expected to
    be converted to SPIR-V instructions will be placed into ::cl::__spirv
    nested namespace. This will allow SPIR-V translator easily distinguish
    those functions from the functions in ::cl namespace that do not have
    SPIR-V counterpart (e.g. from helper functions that are implemented in
    ::cl::__details nested namespace).
    
    Adjust lit tests for OpenCL C++.

