Author: Alexey Bader <aleksey.a.bader@intel.com>
Date:   Mon Jun 22 14:24:21 2015 +0300

    [SPIRV] Fixed handling of linkonce_odr linkage type.
    
    linkonce_odr linkage type is used for template instances and inline
    functions. At the moment there is no way in SPIR-V to optimize linkage
    of SPIR-V modules for template instances, so have to duplicate
    definitions, i.e. set "internal" linkage type for the globals with
    linkonce_odr linkage type.

